Column_Name,Data_Type,Description,Business_Relevance
Order_ID,String,Unique order reference,Identifies orders
Order_Date,Date,Date of purchase,Helps analyze sales trends
Customer_ID,String,Customer identification number,Identifies customers
Customer_Name,String,Name of customer,Helps understand customers
Age,Numeric,Age of customer,Helps analyze age groups
Gender,Categorical,Gender of customer,Helps analyze gender distribution
City,Categorical,Customer city,Helps analyze location-based sales
Product,Categorical,Purchased product,Identifies popular products
Category,Categorical,Product category,Helps compare product categories
Quantity,Integer,Number of items purchased,Measures items sold
Unit_Price,Float,Price of one item,Helps analyze product pricing
Total_Sales,Float,Total purchase amount,Measures total revenue
Duplicate_Order_ID_Flag,Boolean,Identifies records with a repeated Order_ID,Helps investigate order ID quality
Order_Year,Integer,Year extracted from Order_Date,Supports yearly sales analysis
Order_Month,String,Month extracted from Order_Date,Supports monthly sales analysis
Age_Group,Categorical,Customer age category,Supports customer segmentation
